Option 2 (2result.sql) is more accurate because  
• it counts DISTINCT fdic_certificate_number, avoiding duplicate snapshots of the same institution,  
• it uses a case‑insensitive test (LOWER(name) LIKE 'bank%'), so no qualifying bank is missed,  
• it treats NULL asset values as zero only for the asset‑ranking step (safer, though immaterial to the count).

